{"id": "44d57bce-6d97-41bd-937b-548adb29c0eb", "slug": "slide-insights-background-effect", "title": "Slide Insights Background Effect", "description": "Slide Insights Background Effect is designed for adding visual depth with decorative background effects. Key features include layered visual treatments and atmospheric effects. Built with Tailwind CSS, it is suitable for hero backdrops and visual-first marketing layouts. It includes animated visual treatment for strong", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Slide Insights Background Effect\"\ndescription: \"Slide Insights Background Effect is designed for adding visual depth with decorative background effects. Key features include layered visual treatments and atmospheric effects. Built with Tailwind CSS, it is suitable for hero backdrops and visual-first marketing layouts. It includes animated visual treatment for strong\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#059669\"\n  secondary: \"#1A1A1A\"\n  accent: \"#059669\"\n  background: \"#1A1A1A\"\n  surface: \"#F5F4F0\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Playfair Display\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Slide Insights Background Effect\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 4; favorites: 1; remixes: 0.\nTags: background, animated, webgl, effect, dither.\n## Overview\nSlide Insights Background Effect is designed for adding visual depth with decorative background effects. Key features include layered visual treatments and atmospheric effects. Built with Tailwind CSS, it is suitable for hero backdrops and visual-first marketing layouts. It includes animated visual treatment for strong\n\nDesign Slide UX Insights Visual Hierarchy design.co/resources 01 05 pixels that tell a story Vol. 01 — Edition @design.mastery Save for later\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nFollow the rendered preview for headline scale, supporting copy, navigation density, and component placement.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #059669, secondary #1A1A1A, accent #059669, background #1A1A1A, surface #F5F4F0, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Playfair Display for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Design Slide</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@1,400;1,500;1,600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n\n    <style>\n        /* Custom Texture for Paper Effect */\n        .paper-texture {\n            background-color: #F5F4F0;\n            background-image: url(\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg viewBox='0 0 200 200' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg'%3E%3Cfilter id='noiseFilter'%3E%3CfeTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.8' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/%3E%3C/filter%3E%3Crect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23noiseFilter)' opacity='0.08'/%3E%3C/svg%3E\");\n            background-blend-mode: multiply;\n        }\n\n        /* Gradient Border Skill */\n        .gradient-border-mask {\n            position: relative;\n            background: transparent;\n            border-radius: 9999px;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n\n        .gradient-border-mask::before {\n            content: \"\";\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            border-radius: 9999px;\n            padding: 1.5px; /* Border width */\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1A1A1A 0%, #059669 50%, #1A1A1A 100%);\n            -webkit-mask:\n                linear-gradient(#fff 0 0) content-box,\n                linear-gradient(#fff 0 0);\n            -webkit-mask-composite: xor;\n            mask-composite: exclude;\n            opacity: 0.8;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Typography Tweaks */\n        .font-serif-italic {\n            font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;\n            font-style: italic;\n        }\n\n        /* Smooth reveal animation */\n        @keyframes revealUp {\n            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }\n            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }\n        }\n        .reveal {\n            animation: revealUp 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1) forwards;\n            opacity: 0;\n        }\n        .delay-1 { animation-delay: 0.1s; }\n        .delay-2 { animation-delay: 0.2s; }\n        .delay-3 { animation-delay: 0.3s; }\n        .delay-4 { animation-delay: 0.4s; }\n        .delay-5 { animation-delay: 0.5s; }\n\n        /* Canvas positioning */\n        canvas.line-canvas {\n            position: absolute;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 0;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-gray-100 flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen p-4 sm:p-8 font-sans text-gray-900 selection:bg-emerald-100 selection:text-emerald-900\">\n\n    <!-- Main Slide Container (4:5 Ratio) -->\n    <main class=\"paper-texture relative w-full max-w-[600px] aspect-[4/5] shadow-2xl flex flex-col justify-between p-6 sm:p-10 md:p-12 overflow-hidden rounded-sm\">\n\n        <!-- WebGL/Canvas Layer for Lines -->\n        <canvas id=\"linesCanvas\" class=\"line-canvas\"></canvas>\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"relative z-10 flex justify-between items-start text-[10px] sm:text-xs tracking-wide uppercase text-gray-500 font-medium reveal delay-1\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n                <span>UX Insights</span>\n                <!-- Animated Line Placeholder (Canvas will draw here) -->\n                <span class=\"w-8 h-px opacity-0\" data-line-target></span>\n                <span>Visual Hierarchy</span>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"text-right\">\n                design.co/resources\n            </div>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Center Content -->\n        <section class=\"relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center justify-center flex-grow w-full text-center\">\n\n            <!-- Numbering -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium text-gray-800 mb-6 reveal delay-2\">\n                <span>01</span>\n                <span class=\"w-12 h-px opacity-0\" data-line-target></span>\n                <span>05</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Main Title -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col leading-[0.85] tracking-tight text-6xl sm:text-7xl md:text-8xl text-gray-900 mb-8\">\n                <!-- Line 1 -->\n                <span class=\"font-serif-italic text-emerald-700 font-medium block reveal delay-2 transform -rotate-1 origin-center\">\n                    pixels\n                </span>\n                <!-- Line 2 -->\n                <span class=\"font-semibold block reveal delay-3 z-10 mix-blend-multiply\">\n                    that tell\n                </span>\n                <!-- Line 3 -->\n                <div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-center gap-2 sm:gap-4 flex-wrap reveal delay-4\">\n                    <span class=\"font-semibold\">a</span>\n                    <span class=\"font-serif-italic text-emerald-700 font-medium transform translate-y-1 sm:translate-y-2\">\n                        story\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Subtitle / Part -->\n            <div class=\"text-[10px] sm:text-xs tracking-[0.2em] uppercase font-medium text-gray-500 mb-10 reveal delay-5\">\n                Vol. 01 — Edition\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Action Button -->\n            <button class=\"gradient-border-mask group w-12 h-12 sm:w-14 sm:h-14 flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-transparent hover:bg-emerald-50/50 transition-colors duration-300 reveal delay-5 cursor-pointer\" aria-label=\"Next slide\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-gray-800 group-hover:translate-x-0.5 transition-transform duration-300\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- Footer -->\n        <footer class=\"relative z-10 flex justify-between items-end text-gray-800 reveal delay-5\">\n            <!-- Social Actions -->\n            <div class=\"flex gap-4 sm:gap-5 items-center\">\n                <button class=\"hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:heart-linear\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chat-round-line-linear\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:plain-linear\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Handle -->\n            <div class=\"absolute left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 bottom-1 text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-medium text-gray-500 tracking-wide\">\n                @design.mastery\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Save -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 group cursor-pointer\">\n                <span class=\"text-[10px] sm:text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors hidden sm:inline-block\">Save for later</span>\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:bookmark-linear\" class=\"group-hover:text-emerald-700 transition-colors\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></iconify-icon>\n            </div>\n        </footer>\n\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // Canvas Animation for Lines\n        // This script finds elements with 'data-line-target' and draws a line in their place on the canvas\n        // It adds a subtle \"hand-drawn\" wobble animation.\n\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('linesCanvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n        let width, height;\n        let lines = [];\n        let time = 0;\n\n        function resize() {\n            const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n            width = rect.width;\n            height = rect.height;\n            canvas.width = width * window.devicePixelRatio;\n            canvas.height = height * window.devicePixelRatio;\n            ctx.scale(window.devicePixelRatio, window.devicePixelRatio);\n            findLineTargets();\n        }\n\n        function findLineTargets() {\n            lines = [];\n            const targets = document.querySelectorAll('[data-line-target]');\n            const canvasRect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();\n\n            targets.forEach(target => {\n                const rect = target.getBoundingClientRect();\n                lines.push({\n                    x: rect.left - canvasRect.left,\n                    y: rect.top - canvasRect.top + (rect.height / 2),\n                    w: rect.width\n                });\n            });\n        }\n\n        function animate() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n            time += 0.05;\n\n            ctx.beginPath();\n            ctx.strokeStyle = '#1A1A1A'; // Dark gray\n            ctx.lineWidth = 1;\n\n            lines.forEach(line => {\n                // Create a wobbly line\n                const segments = 10;\n                const segmentWidth = line.w / segments;\n\n                ctx.moveTo(line.x, line.y);\n\n                for (let i = 1; i <= segments; i++) {\n                    const x = line.x + (i * segmentWidth);\n                    // Noise based on position and time\n                    const noise = Math.sin(i * 0.5 + time) * 0.5 + Math.cos(time * 0.3) * 0.3;\n                    const y = line.y + noise;\n                    ctx.lineTo(x, y);\n                }\n            });\n\n            ctx.stroke();\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', resize);\n        // Initial setup with a slight delay to ensure layout is settled\n        setTimeout(() => {\n            resize();\n            animate();\n        }, 100);\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "slide-insights-background-effect.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/slide-insights-background-effect.jpg", "source_name": "slide-insights-background-effect-DESIGN.md", "views": 208, "forks": 10, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T21:47:18.344056+00:00"}